Error [jet.ValueTypeMismatch]: `Cell<fn() -> Int>.get()` cannot copy its value
  --> Tests/UI/Ownership/local_cell_get_rejects_values_without_copy_semantics.jet:1:48
    |
  1 | inspect: fn(cell: Cell<fn() -> Int>) { _: cell.get() }
    |                                                ^^^
 Why: `get` returns an independent owned value, so the stored type must support copying
 Fix: Use `.read(fn(value) { ... })` to inspect it without making a copy
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0112
